          "message": {
            "text": "Symmetric encryption key (AES-256)\n\nFixed symmetric encryption key hard-coded in the shared default configuration module and used directly to encrypt sensitive user profile fields."
          },
          "ruleId": "secret-scanning/high",
          "ruleIndex": 14
        },
        {
